            <lg xml:id="m-a2bcf903-854f-46af-9ca8-6829d8416370">
              <l xml:id="m-5ceea1e8-1d45-451a-b789-1f19248b796e" facs="#m-af9f51ca-5071-4a2d-a086-4582b83e9408" label="ambiguous">April 29.</l><l xml:id="m-297fe0b2-9002-4bf0-bda4-fe0d31342e85" facs="#m-307de40b-3339-44b7-83aa-fdad0e91b380" label="ambiguous">1438</l><l xml:id="m-79528538-9ace-4b9a-892f-f8b199da5e17" facs="#m-ad21a176-e484-464f-b3af-7ab429501729" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-4d82dc49-6465-4409-b669-05e8f4735463" facs="#m-7c9a3953-cbaa-4f22-bf38-f3a917e75ad0" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-efdb303c-f2b4-40ea-95d6-136bb948de4b" facs="#m-97942df3-288a-4407-927f-662153726098" label="lyrics-like">Ommu-ni-cántes" Chrísti passi-ó-nibus gaudé¬</l><l xml:id="m-fd07f335-5cfb-489a-8a0b-74bb320584fe" facs="#m-6f22e901-8d8f-48fa-99f0-6f7b43de8784" label="ambiguous">M</l><l xml:id="m-39aeeb35-14e4-4f5c-9f07-31dc5c435f88" facs="#m-2642a908-b4a0-45dc-98a0-d67dbe95e294" label="ambiguous">te, ut in reve-la-ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-3d6623b7-dd43-4a13-8cfc-750281975ec3" facs="#m-66e19e4f-8660-456e-aca0-e6a8805ca22f" label="lyrics-like">ne gló¬ ri-ae é¬</l><l xml:id="m-0b00b3a0-fffe-4ea6-a146-db64de722a31" facs="#m-7a4ce034-3098-4c39-bfac-970ddd9ba312" label="ambiguous">jus</l><l xml:id="m-9e020bb0-e201-49da-b77c-42afc5592bc2" facs="#m-b409cc75-7aea-4510-b539-49f4b40fba5a" label="lyrics-like">exsultán¬</l><l xml:id="m-89a48d32-8c16-473a-8368-f5d337a8ef67" facs="#m-970faf54-d41a-4ea4-b48b-f3cf0a8546be" label="ambiguous">gaude¬</l><l xml:id="m-f9b4d6a8-0f91-40c0-889f-079062cf7b6a" facs="#m-eae2b737-ed8f-42f7-9fba-b6c7736ccf66" label="lyrics-like">á- tis</l><l xml:id="m-53256c9c-5e08-4652-a0a0-de77d135b4f0" facs="#m-90b58932-8ed3-434a-b0f7-e05460bc06a9" label="lyrics-like">tes. Alle lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1501208-d6d3-45a1-835c-cef30dcb0e7a" facs="#m-6e7c68d5-54b9-40b5-9261-fc305a28f025" label="ambiguous">ia.</l><l xml:id="m-3b052a2c-93a4-418a-bcea-42b4e874f7c0" facs="#m-6aae58e1-4020-422c-b73b-bab005ca0125" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-3c445dc5-89f0-4756-b691-bc74931d1ab8" facs="#m-9f1efbb9-d932-4b3a-94b8-8e6a28ce64b1" label="lyrics-like">NUmpsimus, Dómine, divinum ¡ tibus tuis hauriámus in vitam aetér¬</l><l xml:id="m-15e51b52-b032-44e8-8a6d-5abe8f10eea9" facs="#m-61423773-8765-436a-a4a4-4b6543f8d139" label="lyrics-like">O sacraméntum, imménsae cari-l nam saliéntem, et tuam sacratissi¬</l><l xml:id="m-a02c8ee1-90d3-4dfe-8479-e27c8a76cc0d" facs="#m-efe6d83e-8aa8-4b70-a1cf-a33cc093a864" label="lyrics-like">tátis tuae memoriâle perpétuum : mam passiónem córdibus nostris</l><l xml:id="m-35592c14-a79b-403b-85cf-4b550f929c2c" facs="#m-675c3474-b8e7-4e4e-99ee-e0aacd483ace" label="lyrics-like">tribue quaésumus; ut sancti Paulil impréssam móribus et vita teneá¬</l><l xml:id="m-332b1d59-35a5-4d12-90f0-453a179848bb" facs="#m-cc234bc7-37e2-49ab-a15a-5ec70d08e2c4" label="lyrics-like">méritis et imitatióne, aquam de fón- mus: Qui vivis et regnas.</l><l xml:id="m-f72b3fb6-a9dd-4ad1-981c-d2855d3151d7" facs="#m-c74e9afa-c5b4-4d50-9c26-ca163f588758" label="lyrics-like">of St. Vitalis. Postcommunion. Da, quaésumus. 1188.</l><l xml:id="m-deb6e9a9-724e-4415-a25e-6b9695099930" facs="#m-4308074d-7fe6-45c6-84e3-dcbeca4ca422" label="ambiguous">29.</l><l xml:id="m-8250d292-5ec0-4d43-9e65-19a20d1fc548" facs="#m-afa19e79-f692-4d84-91e5-3188c5fe1b40" label="text-like">S. Peter of Verona, Martyr.</l><l xml:id="m-0c04df85-7b2d-4883-95dc-65c39d345127" facs="#m-1133d18f-25ff-4661-90b7-5da70523e56d" label="ambiguous">Double.</l><l xml:id="m-2e98bcff-bcb6-410f-beb1-0966e331f116" facs="#m-6bee5241-1ac1-490f-a794-be10c1ff206a" label="lyrics-like">Mass. Protexísti me. 1146, except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-a9246e4a-6858-46cd-addc-51a5adecfc5f" facs="#m-2146e76c-e9cf-4d1e-9fdb-8740cdd6690f" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-152e9cc3-5f96-4404-9d53-ff34c7e24172" facs="#m-d1a0235a-4f38-48ad-8640-5b1068a8f8a2" label="lyrics-like">DRaesta, quaésumus omnípotens! sectémur;* qui pro ejúsdem fidei</l><l xml:id="m-c0e28b70-6410-4925-9369-42b1e5f19d5d" facs="#m-8ca779c9-4eda-4a5f-8e05-2a75fa97120c" label="lyrics-like">L Deus: t ut beáti Petri Már-] dilatatióne, martyrii palmam méruit</l><l xml:id="m-bdcee1dd-1d9b-4f4a-aafc-3dea5904be32" facs="#m-775e1bb8-8559-4df9-82b7-3df6df3967ef" label="lyrics-like">tyris tui fidem cóngrua devotióne ! obtinére. Per Dóminum nostrum.</l><l xml:id="m-896a8e9b-a220-4d83-b3d7-cca077d7982b" facs="#m-8f01108e-83fd-4a21-b15a-fe3db2ddfc61" label="ambiguous">Epistle. Memor esto. p. 1139.</l><l xml:id="m-d28389ee-81b8-4927-a41e-9681d703535b" facs="#m-dc5364d3-daa9-48a8-a77c-05c20bf799c1" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-fc55cbf0-56d5-4ca9-ad78-3236cf548b36" facs="#m-3fe2cc9f-f02a-4f58-83e6-b5ab07d14184" label="lyrics-like">DReces, quas tibi Dómine offé-] et propugnatóres fídei sub tua pro¬</l><l xml:id="m-f1d15d65-22c5-4aef-b8fb-99512f9417e0" facs="#m-cb97ab3a-50da-4364-8cd7-fab18cab815f" label="lyrics-like">Lrimus, intercedénte beáto Pe-l tectióne custódi. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-31a40e66-65a1-42ed-8907-2242b58723c4" facs="#m-9dcfef3f-d171-42d1-b389-f592b8271b1f" label="lyrics-like">tro Mártyre tuo, cleménter inténde:</l><l xml:id="m-efdad74c-1b9c-416f-affe-c5a442ff3a93" facs="#m-3bb36c60-f920-41e2-8ad8-1260cae56886" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-6cc6211a-0e25-4a47-918e-375a2667988c" facs="#m-7ea443a5-bae0-483c-b94c-63eb319fb4e5" label="lyrics-like">LrIdéles tuos, Dómine, custódiant! tyre tuo, contra omnes advérsos</l><l xml:id="m-500c03c5-0c0f-4bb8-885e-dc25a4d54e11" facs="#m-31a2786e-2016-4254-9f04-9472278eba3b" label="lyrics-like">sacraménta quae súmpsimus:</l><l xml:id="m-751121b1-6088-4fa2-ad54-9d090c48d65c" facs="#m-cc694580-f883-49d6-8900-83555cf2a10a" label="lyrics-like">tueántur incúrsus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-01795965-4306-40f4-b53c-33caa6992107" facs="#m-7effbe71-e106-4d25-b308-5d726ef1b421" label="lyrics-like">et, intercedénte beato Petro Már¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
